# CTA to section bottom

After a section CTA, keep **32px** (`--space-32`) of space before the section’s bottom edge or the next section.

Do not let a button sit flush on the following section.

Match the gold closing CTA (`py-space-32`) and the mobile hero (`padding-bottom: 32px`).

Do not steal this space by tightening headline, image, or overlay composition.
